{"2143600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Axom: Conquest", "steam_appid": 2143600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/3a0d39aee4f279a981c390524786a4ac.poster.avif?t=1781979281\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/3a0d39aee4f279a981c390524786a4ac.webm?t=1781979281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/3a0d39aee4f279a981c390524786a4ac.mp4?t=1781979281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Axom: Conquest</strong> is a hold-out style Tower Defence Roguelite for strategy fans who love breaking games with overpowered builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an impenetrable fortress, unlock bowling towers, nukes and a tiny robot named Jeff. Defend from thousands of relentless physics-driven alien swarms and unlock powerful meta-progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Difficulties to conquer + Endless mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1781979281\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/fbb6ea240b825b4b71afd0c6fe3f83b7.webp?t=1781979281\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_im